    "detailed_description": "&quot;ActionHacker&quot; is a casual sneak-action game in which the player controls the main character, an electric man, to reach the server room, the innermost room.<br />\r\nThe path to the server room is lined with many security robots and security systems.<br />\r\nThe objective of the game is to control the main character &quot;Elec,&quot; an electric human, and use his special powers and hacking skills to reach the server room.<br />\r\nElectrical outlets, laser sensors, and even water splashed on the floor can be turned into paths leading to the server room.<br />\r\nHowever, Elec's stamina decreases over time. Break into the server room before his energy is completely depleted and get the hidden secret!",
